  "title": "Juicy Rich Kenyan Guanciale Stew",
  "description": "A rich and juicy Kenyan stew featuring guanciale, this dish is perfect for a cozy night in, and is also FODMAP-friendly. The guanciale adds a smoky and savory flavor to the stew.",
