  "instructions": [
    "Heat the garlic-infused oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the guanciale and cook until crispy, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the beef broth, potatoes, carrots, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the vegetables are tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
